  "2026-10-06T11:18:11.080Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete live all-status corpus contained 2896 items with no unreadable items or omissions. The exact three-report search matched only parent pm-f05lsg. Full open and in-progress checks and all-status recovery searches found no bounded delivery task for this tranche. This is a child delivery record of the existing feature and does not duplicate its unfinished exhaustive census scope."
  "2026-10-06T11:49:34.885Z","harness:codex","Local completion: All 13 linked recovery cases pass; separately installed Node and Bun execute strict resolved identity, canonical examples, contradictory selection refusal, preview-history preservation and explicit guidance inspection/add. Canonical full suite passes 9789 runnable tests with only two established Windows-only skips. All 764 maintained source files have zero uncovered counts: statements66841/66841; branches51174/51174; functions13809/13809; lines63702/63702. Complete static pipeline, all four TypeScript configurations, 58 token surfaces, docs links, packed artifact and nine-package npx/bunx smoke pass. Bunx smoke uses a fresh owned temporary cache after the host cache symlink was refused; no host cache or gate is weakened. Required current production Sentry/telemetry gate passes with zero blocking issues and finish-error rate2.06% with zero missing error-code rows. Hosted exact-head review remains required before merge; this is implemented local-source evidence and does not claim published registry adoption."
  "2026-10-06T13:06:49.659Z","harness:codex","Review round1: both strengthened real recovery tests pass on the existing source before implementation changes. A direct public SDK strict create with explicit refused-author is rejected with exitCode2; caller ambient author provenance is unchanged and the following create records exactly test-author. This contradicts the proposed later-attribution failure: the asynchronous create boundary does not replace the caller context, and each successful mutation resolves its own identity. Retain this executable negative control rather than undoing required resolved-author validation. Scoped status now asserts the actual tracker path, mode, missing managed block, target AGENTS.md and exact checked/missing file sets. Explicit status-required policy remains intentional when a type has no configured default_status; prior GH1337 preview refusal is already shipped and reverified by the linked suite."
  "2026-10-06T13:54:44.176Z","harness:codex","Review round1 local acceptance: the complete canonical suite passes 9790 runnable tests with only the two established Windows-only skips. Every one of 764 maintained source files has zero uncovered counts: statements66843/66843, branches51178/51178, functions13809/13809, lines63704/63704. The complete static sequence passes after CLI restoration of active expected-result fields; no source, performance, mutation, security or coverage limit was changed. All four TypeScript configurations and documentation links pass. Independently packed and installed npm/Node and Bun consumers each pass eight amount/projection variants over exact 30-row ordering, concurrent one-winner creation and both public conflict guards; npx and bunx execute the installed CLI and stable conflict refusal. Both runtimes also pass strict resolved identity, canonical examples, incompatible-selection refusal, byte-identical preview history and scoped guidance inspection/explicit add. Artifact19964509bytes remains below the unchanged20000000byte ceiling. This is source and candidate-artifact proof, not registry deployment; a fresh exact-head hosted review remains required before merge."
